{
  "title": "【怪現象】別れた彼女の声で「返して」が聞こえるんだが",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:13:00 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">別れて二ヶ月。昨日の夜、押し入れの方から元カノの声で「返して」って聞こえた。荷物は全部返したはずなんだが。こういうのって何から確認すればいい？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:14:18 ID:N4vT8hL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まず押し入れを開けろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:16:23 ID:C9wF3sJ6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">未練が音声になったか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:17:06 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">開けたけど段ボールしかない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:18:36 ID:D2qB7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何時に聞こえた？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:20:53 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">十一時半くらい。テレビ消した直後</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:21:48 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">隣の部屋の声じゃないの</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:23:30 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">元カノの声は三年聞いてた。似てるとかじゃなくて本人の声</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:25:59 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それが一番怖い</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:27:06 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何を返してほしいんだろうな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:29:00 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res1\">&gt;&gt;1</a> 借りた物を思い出せ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:29:32 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">本と傘は返した。合鍵も郵送した</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:30:51 ID:C9wF3sJ6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">心を返せ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:32:57 ID:N4vT8hL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それは返品不可</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:33:41 ID:D2qB7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">別れ方は揉めたのか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:35:12 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">喧嘩したけど最後は普通に話した。連絡は取ってない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:37:30 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">携帯に録音して確認しよう</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:38:26 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今夜また聞こえたらやる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:40:09 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">電話して聞くのはやめとけよ。余計こじれる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:42:39 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">押し入れの中身は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:43:47 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">冬服、古い布団、彼女が置いていった小さい箱</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:45:42 ID:N4vT8hL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">最後のやつを先に言え</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:46:15 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">アクセサリーの箱かと思ってた。開けてない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:47:35 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">人の忘れ物を二ヶ月放置してるのか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:49:42 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">連絡したくなくてな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:50:27 ID:D2qB7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まず箱の中身を見たら？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:51:59 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今開けた。丸い時計みたいな物が入ってる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:54:18 ID:C9wF3sJ6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">時限爆弾</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:55:15 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">茶化すなｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:56:59 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">裏に録音ボタンがある。電池も入ってる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 21:59:30 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ほぼ答えじゃないか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:00:39 ID:N4vT8hL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">声を録音できる時計？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:02:35 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">説明書がない。液晶に23:30って出てる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:03:09 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res6\">&gt;&gt;6</a> と時間が一致してるな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:04:30 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">毎日鳴ってたのに昨日初めて気づいた？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:06:38 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">普段は十一時前に寝る。昨日は眠れなかった</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:07:24 ID:D2qB7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">じゃあ今夜も同じ時刻に鳴るか確認</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:08:57 ID:C9wF3sJ6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「返して」は何を指してるんだろう</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:11:17 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">時計自身が帰宅を希望してる説</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:12:15 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">電池抜こうと思ったけど、とりあえずそのまま置く</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:14:00 ID:N4vT8hL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">箱から出して机に置いとけ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:16:32 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そうする。明日報告する</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:17:42 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">元カノの声ってだけでつらいよな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:19:39 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まあ機械なら安心だ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res45\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">45：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/04(金) 22:20:14 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">録音内容が怖かったら無理して聞くなよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res46\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">46：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/05(土) 21:20:14 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今帰宅した。時計を机に出した</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res47\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">47：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/05(土) 21:22:23 ID:D2qB7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今日はちゃんと起きてるか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/05(土) 21:23:10 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">コーヒー飲んで待機中</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res49\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">49：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/05(土) 21:24:44 ID:C9wF3sJ6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">失恋板で時計の実況をするとは</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res50\" style=\"f