v></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res55\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">55：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/05(土) 22:18:46 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">急に怖くなった</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res56\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">56：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/05(土) 22:19:22 ID:D2qB7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何を返すのか言ってない？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res57\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">57：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/05(土) 22:20:45 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そのあと小さい音で何か言ってる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res58\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">58：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2011/11/05(土) 22:22:55 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">携帯で録音して聞き直せ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res59\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">59：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/11/05(土) 22:23:43 ID:K7mP2qR9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">録れた。雑音が